  "description": "T1 - mature lime pollard - to be reduced back to pollard points. Reduction of 7m in height. Total canopy size at the moment is 10m in height, 6m in width. After works canopy size will be 3m in height and 1m in width. \r\nT2 - neighbouring yew tree to be trimmed lightly into shape. \r\nT3 - neighbouring bay tree to be cut back and trimmed to boundary level. \r\nT4 - dying cabbage palm to be removed and ground out. \r\nTG1 - X4 large dead red robin trees to be removed and ground out. \r\nTG2 - X7 large red robin trees to be reduced lightly by 0.5-1m over clients garden. Height will be untouched. Canopy width is currently 7m, final width is 6m. Remove deadwood throughout. \r\nTG3 - x4 bay trees to be trimmed lightly into tidy shapes.",
